)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/fVC2tOp44gVsrGzUqB745PzgZzk.jpg","tmdbId":1179888},{"name":"Nicolas Wanczycki","character":"Alexis Mayard","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/xksvgEBrpOB26BCga8JDqHZRRqZ.jpg","tmdbId":1122960},{"name":"Negzzia","character":"Amal Mayard","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/wu8PXB7dHxuph4Dl6ysSooHq6Qa.jpg","tmdbId":6392467},{"name":"Marley Duboscq","character":"Petit Jean","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/fJ9JUPQiir2LYFOHopzoBRl7OLY.jpg","tmdbId":3450010},{"name":"Leah Aubert","character":"Manon Berger (fille de Jessica et David)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/w0WuQeMD0i26yXpryEcnTQriEtX.jpg","tmdbId":3769103}],"directors":[{"name":"Julien Leclercq","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/xP2OPVSMg2S19A1KzECnaqswqh8.jpg","tmdbId":84439}],"writers":[{"name":"Julien Leclercq","character":"Julien Leclercq","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/xP2OPVSMg2S19A1KzECnaqswqh8.jpg","tmdbId":84439},{"name":"Sylvain Caron","character":"Sylvain Caron","photo":null,"tmdbId":3119156},{"name":"Elsa Vasseur","character":"Elsa Vasseur","photo":null,"tmdbId":4101086},{"name":"Victor Lockwood","character":"Victor Lockwood","photo":null,"tmdbId":3306938},{"name":"Léa Raud","character":"Léa Raud","photo":null,"tmdbId":5162737}],"certification":"TV-MA","seasonPosters":["https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cPiptzvcccUUtkS18z5e3fS9Uw.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt35495063:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"Episodio 1","overview":"David, un oficial de alto rango del GIGN, se prepara para dejar atrás las operaciones de campo. Pero la graduación de un nuevo recluta y un ataque impactante cambian sus planes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/66tcm3jBg5AFUunr6iWjDINbN5c.jpg","released":"2026-07-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"tt35495063:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Episodio 2","overview":"El equipo, devastado por los sucesos de la noche anterior y bajo escrutinio, sigue la pista de un sospechoso. En una misión, Max desobedece una orden de David.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9KxmBRUcGXpOC8S3oRdHHZje2Kf.jpg","released":"2026-07-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"52 min"},{"id":"tt35495063:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Episodio 3","overview":"Tras el tiroteo en el bosque, David consigue una prueba clave. Max sigue haciendo preguntas sobre la muerte de su padre. Una visita al hospital da un giro inesperado.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/480WpYGLoGSoiE0S2uQkmSqoPaD.jpg","released":"2026-07-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"42 min"},{"id":"tt35495063:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Episodio 4","overview":"David vincula a la mente maestra detrás de los ataques a una operación antigua y se embarca en una misión en solitario..., pero no es el único en busca de respuestas.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sp3SeKiLkOk5zCVwM1f8V9qFjpM.jpg","released":"2026-07-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"44 min"},{"id":"tt35495063:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Episodio 5","overview":"David enfrenta las consecuencias de sus actos. Al ser interrogado, intenta proteger a Max y termina diciéndole toda la verdad.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jm2EbD568qLF0aj2KRWLPZ5xjKa.jpg","released":"2026-07-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"51 min"},{"id":"tt35495063:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Episodio 6","overview":"Al enterarse de la toma de rehenes, el equipo pone en marcha una misión de rescate y trata de derribar a una hábil asesina sin nada que perder.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Amj7n5TTqmohgtZ2rrRfgJuqS8G.jpg","released":"2026-07-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"48 min"}]}}